{"id": "official:sentence:bad9ba8e-ab28-4b92-bf1c-611e0d63cb54", "text": "这是我第一次看牙医。", "shortMeaning": "这是我头一回看牙医。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fca52a8a-f1c6-41b1-91b1-8ae3f7ced099", "text": "这是我第一次长胡子。", "shortMeaning": "这是我头一回留胡子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56c8c5e4-8707-4a4b-ae53-293717798ed6", "text": "这是我第二次来到这座小镇。", "shortMeaning": "这是我第二回来这小镇。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec6626c4-a9c0-4f33-b491-1807018b6a1a", "text": "这是我第二次独自到中国。", "shortMeaning": "这是我第二回一个人到中国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab34d89c-b2b7-4b1e-a140-986ca1b1f4bf", "text": "这是我能为您做的。", "shortMeaning": "我能为您做的就这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a61ab200-e603-4e70-8ac6-5ea5ec907d3f", "text": "这是我自己做的，你可别来碰瓷！", "shortMeaning": "这是我自己做的，你别来讹人！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4d1352e-da10-4d12-a33c-a5f9a9023114", "text": "这是我自己的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "这辆车是我自己的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7a6ecfb-0e31-4212-bcf2-e2c25e88c5ac", "text": "这是我见过最好的照片。", "shortMeaning": "我见过的照片里这张最好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c6599be-04d2-496e-9df0-234371332f45", "text": "这是我见过最美的景色了。", "shortMeaning": "这景是我见过最美的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cbe0012-e453-4ee9-ba5c-f467b9230eed", "text": "这是我见过的最高的树。", "shortMeaning": "我见过的树里这棵最高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e556bb3b-fb81-4f73-94ec-e34bff028b42", "text": "这是我见过的最高的男人了。", "shortMeaning": "我见过的人里他最高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f65eef36-e2ab-495f-bf09-ec28d40e534b", "text": "这是我该计划的事。", "shortMeaning": "这是我该规划的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49e08ac1-8a68-4513-9d35-e9c3937dad3c", "text": "这是我读过的书里面写的最差的一本了。", "shortMeaning": "我读过的书里，这本写得最差。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d773b3fb-77a0-4668-9630-2c0fb1f90bd0", "text": "这是我跟您提过的记者团。", "shortMeaning": "这是我向您提过的记者团。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e19d057-1b1f-420a-8395-c7feeb530340", "text": "这是我身上发生的最糟糕的事了！", "shortMeaning": "这是我碰上最糟的事！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8c6ff8d-a1ec-49a8-a54c-9dfb03e19396", "text": "这是我这辈子犯下的最大的错。", "shortMeaning": "这是我这辈子最大的错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9545e075-6805-48a8-8982-82384cfbfc29", "text": "这是战斗发生的地方。", "shortMeaning": "打仗就发生在这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:143c3dc0-78db-4ed4-b802-1ecb4d206769", "text": "这是报纸还是杂志？", "shortMeaning": "这是报还是杂志？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27f6795e-9896-4ac1-9f43-53a7bbf28dba", "text": "这是搭帐篷的好地方。", "shortMeaning": "这儿搭帐篷正合适。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4850afbb-3ec7-482e-bd0d-8e4c2b96ebe7", "text": "这是日本最深的湖。", "shortMeaning": "日本最深的湖就是它。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef05a37d-d052-43a8-93ed-33b9e599a626", "text": "这是是图书馆的书吗？", "shortMeaning": "这书属于图书馆吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a688606-0a7e-46bf-aebd-bb3fb079b58d", "text": "这是最近才发生的。", "shortMeaning": "这是最近才出的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8a7ebef-19dd-4aa9-af37-b048bdd76a65", "text": "这是本反乌托邦作品。", "shortMeaning": "这本书属于反乌托邦一类。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91622b26-f5de-4b24-bfe4-94865917134d", "text": "这是本有教育意义的书。", "shortMeaning": "这是本有教益的书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9efa926-c99a-40e6-8e6c-135b679a66b3", "text": "这是本有趣的书，不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "这书挺有趣，不是吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28d5d47b-6144-4b52-80ab-514ae612e5a6", "text": "这是条有趣的信息。", "shortMeaning": "这条消息挺有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c49170b0-90f2-4e3b-b81a-80c3d311025c", "text": "这是来自美国的船只停靠的港口。", "shortMeaning": "美国来的船都停这个港口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98fc6e69-900a-4c64-925e-4bc9d3f20f1f", "text": "这是片干燥地区，几乎是一片荒漠。", "shortMeaning": "这一带很干，差不多是荒漠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:023b6b02-424c-4e2d-bdbd-2f3e645cfe39", "text": "这是白纸黑字写在这儿的你怎么还怀疑？", "shortMeaning": "白纸黑字写在这儿，你还疑什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd611f8c-eeae-45c8-834a-b923d4bfe5d9", "text": "这是看樱花的最好时节。", "shortMeaning": "现在看樱花最合适不过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd0739f6-0e6b-496a-aab8-b14db10d9792", "text": "这是篇信息量很大的文章。", "shortMeaning": "这篇文章给的信息很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3645e7bd-eb44-45f0-a234-1cd60787b43a", "text": "这是自动投币电话，用一元硬币来打的。", "shortMeaning": "这是投币电话，投一元硬币打。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc6c9987-417a-4de5-a8d5-d902da65ae2b", "text": "这是要卖的东西吗？", "shortMeaning": "这东西是拿来卖的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d196c1ee-e3cd-494a-8181-fac482360156", "text": "这是警报：洪水就要来了。", "shortMeaning": "这是警报：洪水要来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f11cf740-7986-4362-a220-dba9b4928597", "text": "这是谁的你知道吗？", "shortMeaning": "你知道这是谁的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61e28b2a-e1ef-428a-8017-194b0a240c37", "text": "这是这个诗人出生的村子。", "shortMeaning": "这位诗人就出生在这个村。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d0f557c-e8fb-45e1-9abe-a4823dd1351c", "text": "这是这国家历史上第一次。", "shortMeaning": "这在该国历史上是头一回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
