{"id": "official:sentence:c8467732-4017-439b-add2-306e290e8678", "text": "这是邮局，那是银行。", "shortMeaning": "这边是邮局，那边是银行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88874403-73a3-45ac-b8bf-d71808597bc5", "text": "这是部很复杂的机器。", "shortMeaning": "这是台很复杂的机器。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:439343ce-fb40-4bcf-b1e4-48fe3fd9f3d6", "text": "这是非常好的土壤。", "shortMeaning": "这土非常好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4ee1a26-6ca5-49b8-b4d7-00fd3c35a675", "text": "这是非常，非常不好的东西。", "shortMeaning": "这是非常非常坏的东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:540bf29a-7c72-496c-b2e4-35229aaf6db2", "text": "这显然是今年出版的最好的小说。", "shortMeaning": "这显然是今年最好的小说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0659ac2c-16f1-40fd-9c6f-024eb301d4c8", "text": "这显然是将属并列关系的两件事误解成为因果关系了。", "shortMeaning": "这显然把并列的两件事当成了因果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ec0908c-fdaf-46c6-a012-2ba9a1fa0379", "text": "这有一股芝士的味道。", "shortMeaning": "这里有一股奶酪味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42641b69-3a41-4985-86cc-bf4a308342ce", "text": "这本书上写，大象能活过一百岁。", "shortMeaning": "书上说，大象能活过一百岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cd79c69-72bb-40e6-ab4a-1d7c77ba50fd", "text": "这本书不像那本那么容易。", "shortMeaning": "这本书没那本容易。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3fde0e9d-0418-4238-947c-f61eddc4d8b5", "text": "这本书不是给年轻读者看的。", "shortMeaning": "这书不是写给年轻读者的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c0ef4bf-cbd0-47d5-8b64-a2cc83e29b03", "text": "这本书五岁小孩都能读。", "shortMeaning": "这书五岁孩子都读得懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ab63f80-d1ba-4516-86dd-6e01474b6021", "text": "这本书他们读起来够简单了。", "shortMeaning": "这书他们读着够简单。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b938710-8b2f-4576-a941-060666886c20", "text": "这本书会对我们有很大用处。", "shortMeaning": "这书对我们大有用处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ffb79dd-a5fa-49f7-991a-8cb77945f878", "text": "这本书你该还给他。", "shortMeaning": "这书你该还给他了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f701bb42-e015-4004-ab5e-86946b798b41", "text": "这本书值得再看一遍。", "shortMeaning": "这书值得再读一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c76b9089-a831-4332-b548-5bc8b797809b", "text": "这本书关于生活在英国。", "shortMeaning": "这本书讲的是在英国生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfd972a9-35b0-4e25-8a36-31ddc99653d7", "text": "这本书包含了许多美丽的插图。", "shortMeaning": "这书里有很多好看的插图。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
