{"id": "official:sentence:f3616277-adbb-496a-9333-f6acce36d4e2", "text": "这本书太贵了。我买不起。", "shortMeaning": "这书太贵，我买不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41a75d75-2428-4813-b284-ee7330f8055a", "text": "这本书对于我来说太难了。", "shortMeaning": "这书对我来说太难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:260599ff-dbb5-4313-8c6c-9eae384f6671", "text": "这本书对你来说读起来太难了。", "shortMeaning": "这书你读起来太难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffc28408-3df1-4234-9c37-351f1b54ae45", "text": "这本书对我来说很难读。", "shortMeaning": "这书我读着很难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22dc0b04-7d25-4746-98f8-6fba68c76004", "text": "这本书对我而言太贵了。", "shortMeaning": "这书对我太贵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3cb1091-300e-47b0-ad1a-f836ee032fae", "text": "这本书对新手来说是一本很好的手册。", "shortMeaning": "对新手来说，这书是本好手册。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3aa8548-7487-49a3-b205-6956d16bfdb0", "text": "这本书很好懂，对我来说。", "shortMeaning": "这书我读着挺好懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
