{"id": "official:sentence:d6dff562-8f35-46fd-9e5b-9bdb05b9aa0b", "text": "这本书是用简单英语写成的，让初学者看得懂。", "shortMeaning": "这书用简单英语写成，初学者也看得懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:286e07f5-99c1-4a7e-9887-599af45a62e3", "text": "这本书有平装书版本的吗？", "shortMeaning": "这书有平装本吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba09ede1-e9dd-4041-81a2-5c0070c50e30", "text": "这本书有很多插图。", "shortMeaning": "这书插图很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf6eb716-d8c8-42bf-9206-c727cd0ec15c", "text": "这本书有精美的插图。", "shortMeaning": "这书的插图很精美。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3cfc693-e636-4ecc-89aa-0e101c4e36c6", "text": "这本书没劲儿，越看越想合上它。", "shortMeaning": "这书没劲，越看越想合上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:445d536f-b8f1-4905-8641-8c8953eb6baf", "text": "这本书没那本书大。", "shortMeaning": "这书没那本大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a0f2479-49c3-4437-9608-15a14ad7e2f2", "text": "这本书满眼都是荤段子。", "shortMeaning": "这书里全是荤段子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa1b70e6-2f7b-43c3-9071-f97af8c514f1", "text": "这本书的主题是美国革命。", "shortMeaning": "这书讲的是美国革命。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d29fa49f-4eea-4381-9446-dfd7df104954", "text": "这本书的内容是什么？", "shortMeaning": "这书里写的是什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51bf2394-d694-448b-845e-0d37d5897041", "text": "这本书的名字是什么？", "shortMeaning": "这书叫什么名？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00a724f1-e7dc-4426-9e85-6dc53f38f6fc", "text": "这本书的目的不在于教你怎么编程，而在于计算的本质。", "shortMeaning": "这书不是教你编程，而是讲计算的本质。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d39ce58a-3372-42dc-bc6c-f5891e9e0321", "text": "这本书虽然很厚，但是不贵。", "shortMeaning": "这书虽厚，价钱不贵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dff1695a-74f0-481a-9fa4-28c2eb63966b", "text": "这本书读来很有趣。", "shortMeaning": "这书读着很有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65579c89-5d0e-4a31-bb3a-35cec8f83f8c", "text": "这本书谁想要就给谁吧。", "shortMeaning": "这书谁要就给谁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6113ffc8-bc5c-4c01-8027-aed814d3b3e5", "text": "这本书里面有四十张照片。", "shortMeaning": "这书里有四十张照片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:469b4968-a6e2-4431-bcfc-6bd71f0fb9a6", "text": "这本单词本子上记的1000个英语单词，七月份之前要全部背下来。", "shortMeaning": "这单词本上的1000个英语词，七月前要全背下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65b61e19-2e7c-4662-a534-7c135b17ea58", "text": "这本字典包含了约4万个词条。", "shortMeaning": "这本词典收了约4万个词条。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7903f6d-4077-40d3-b9d8-4eb099b3fef4", "text": "这本字典对我很实用。", "shortMeaning": "这本词典我用着实用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:370b72d3-fc32-439e-8ab3-e1de384b51c7", "text": "这本字典对我有很大用处。", "shortMeaning": "这本词典对我用处很大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45b6c400-3577-4c4b-b337-139dae8a0187", "text": "这本小说的作者是谁？", "shortMeaning": "这本小说谁写的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61ec89b9-302f-4434-bcb3-5fd5739a856c", "text": "这本挂历挂哪儿好呢？", "shortMeaning": "这本挂历挂哪儿合适？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:861ec5dd-9981-43b6-b6a0-89e795be9f25", "text": "这本教科书是用简单的英语写的。", "shortMeaning": "这本教材是用浅易英语写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f748d11a-baaa-4b39-af2b-ff8a647833d2", "text": "这本杂志不要扔。我还没看呢。", "shortMeaning": "这杂志别扔，我还没看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae353412-45c8-4815-8352-9db664a1b2f8", "text": "这本汉语书对我们来说没有太难。", "shortMeaning": "这本汉语书对我们不算太难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e106d98-8d9a-438d-9b22-a4e72a352b22", "text": "这本笔记本不是你的，是他的。", "shortMeaning": "这本子不是你的，是他的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0db8fd07-676b-4571-a834-74ef2ed49447", "text": "这本词典当然是最好的。", "shortMeaning": "这本词典当然最好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78d1eb76-dc4e-43f0-9298-d2b06ba9a5f7", "text": "这朵花在这些花中是最美的。", "shortMeaning": "这些花里这朵最美。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb031e67-830f-4674-b2e0-f9d575c7d790", "text": "这朵花散发出强烈的香味。", "shortMeaning": "这朵花香得很冲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ddd959ab-2741-4d97-b8ad-59070d2f9633", "text": "这朵花是所有花中最漂亮的。", "shortMeaning": "所有花里这朵最好看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67b39c90-4cb6-4920-b789-fc3787f99aa7", "text": "这朵花的颜色是紫色。", "shortMeaning": "这朵花是紫色的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc593a91-0c50-4ba5-9dfc-710b6a0dc85d", "text": "这条巷子安静得吓人。", "shortMeaning": "这条巷子静得瘆人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6caaff4e-2ab6-42ed-be2d-5cecd81c79cc", "text": "这条弄堂一直走走到底。", "shortMeaning": "这条弄堂一直走到头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41ed25cd-476c-4fef-b985-8aa41be5c66d", "text": "这条新闻哄动了世界。", "shortMeaning": "这条新闻轰动了世界。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e107181-7dd6-42ee-8008-45c0ff6616b2", "text": "这条毛巾蓬松又柔软，特别舒服。", "shortMeaning": "这条毛巾又蓬又软，很舒服。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97571634-8c27-444f-b4bf-fc1e3dd3462b", "text": "这条河是欧洲最宽的。", "shortMeaning": "欧洲最宽的河是这条。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a617c7d-d1d0-41c2-8933-7a3f3ce48ee6", "text": "这条河比那条长三倍。", "shortMeaning": "这条河的长度是那条的三倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff33e128-5cf9-44d5-86f7-7feee7f9c198", "text": "这条河汇入太平洋。", "shortMeaning": "这条河流进太平洋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f610cb1-9b2f-4fac-81d5-55968e49f739", "text": "这条河里有很多鱼。", "shortMeaning": "这条河里鱼很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b3222c0-81a1-4b89-ad01-326c436344c2", "text": "这条河里有很多鲑鱼。", "shortMeaning": "这条河里鲑鱼很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b22aa6df-d390-4403-b8de-2a82c25e0383", "text": "这条法律依然有效。", "shortMeaning": "这条法律还有效。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd249d33-f43e-4c28-afab-41a17439490e", "text": "这条消息是法语写的。", "shortMeaning": "这条消息是用法语写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfbc2080-545a-4041-8293-8c57dd5ff107", "text": "这条狗几乎和人一样。", "shortMeaning": "这条狗差不多跟人一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e71910e8-2c0a-4896-971b-24190b4ff61f", "text": "这条狗几乎是一个人。", "shortMeaning": "这条狗简直像个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cba5b66-89ca-48b1-9b65-92e4b53933db", "text": "这条狗见陌生人就吠。", "shortMeaning": "这条狗一见生人就叫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f0ae79a8-aedf-45a8-94cc-69ae064b2a48", "text": "这条短信只是为了通知您我刚把关于我们合作关系的信息页面放到网上。", "shortMeaning": "这条短信只是告诉你，我刚把咱们合作的信息页放到网上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cca8d5f7-5e0a-460b-97e5-ced31677e923", "text": "这条裙子你穿着很合身。", "shortMeaning": "这条裙子你穿很合身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:567ca3bd-ec4e-45bc-826c-51034a629a4e", "text": "这条裙子很适合你。", "shortMeaning": "这条裙子很衬你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cd6d2b7-32b0-42a3-b277-6f8f94715449", "text": "这条规则不是任何情况下都奏效的。", "shortMeaning": "这条规矩不是哪儿都管用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a71a37c-ee8b-4c99-a89e-3085d8600c5f", "text": "这条规则可以按不同方式解释。", "shortMeaning": "这条规矩能有好几种解释。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ea19d68-5d01-4c3d-af0b-265bf934ea02", "text": "这条规则对当今的情况已经不适用了。", "shortMeaning": "这条规矩对现在的情况已经不管用了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87195c22-2aa1-4a9b-be55-d1fc2968051f", "text": "这条规定不许例外。", "shortMeaning": "这条规定不许有例外。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:482bd2a5-3527-40d2-a251-35007058739d", "text": "这条路太窄，过不了车。", "shortMeaning": "这路太窄，车过不去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26ca302c-e442-4ebc-96ba-da08f044e34a", "text": "这条路很容易被挖掘，因为地面很松软。", "shortMeaning": "这路容易挖开，因为地很松软。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9141f3ae-00c1-4f9d-bfb5-70f8c9f570f5", "text": "这条路是不是直接通往普拉多博物馆？", "shortMeaning": "这条路直达普拉多博物馆吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a132ccc-eed1-47ec-bee5-54de0bb2a4ef", "text": "这条路的路基看起来很坚固。", "shortMeaning": "这路的路基看着很结实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16412b65-7f59-45fe-86e7-88573311c5ff", "text": "这条路连接东京和大阪。", "shortMeaning": "这条路连着东京和大阪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74c7add1-95d9-4748-89a0-9f860bf0a36d", "text": "这条领带很配你的衣服。", "shortMeaning": "这条领带配你那身衣裳正好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b1026ab-d5e6-4186-8c0d-969c0b4da294", "text": "这条领带颜色亮一点，跟这件西装比较配。", "shortMeaning": "这条领带颜色亮些，更配这套西装。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebae8876-dffe-469c-8658-67a0b8875e1f", "text": "这条马路在修理呢。", "shortMeaning": "这条路正在修。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db02b5bf-e35d-4692-a0f2-bfb51b222c56", "text": "这条鱼是什么颜色？", "shortMeaning": "这鱼是什么颜色？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eb56481-fa01-42a9-bb02-6ece7c3eba40", "text": "这条鱼用英语叫什么？", "shortMeaning": "这种鱼英语怎么说？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5619f0c7-df10-4c91-80a7-76bdfb529d8b", "text": "这条鱼还是活的吗？", "shortMeaning": "这鱼还活着吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30eda881-7df7-42d8-a9d4-a3531f2d1594", "text": "这果子还太酸，没法吃。", "shortMeaning": "这果子太酸，吃不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69d8352d-7496-4bae-92f2-1d682fb4d8f7", "text": "这架太空船被离子推进器推动。", "shortMeaning": "这艘飞船由离子推进器驱动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81425af7-cfa6-4d41-a9a5-cb163711095e", "text": "这栋建筑不是一座寺庙。", "shortMeaning": "这栋建筑不是庙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d2e0b16-a2c5-4268-a009-62a3906eec2d", "text": "这栋楼里面有中央暖气系统吗？", "shortMeaning": "这楼里有中央暖气吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:457ebd6e-5d13-41d4-b649-b1b4abe26b9f", "text": "这样之后我就有空和你聊天了。", "shortMeaning": "这样一来我就有空跟你聊了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8bb313fe-a486-4056-9da2-d4688f12b845", "text": "这样也很可能是最好玩儿的。", "shortMeaning": "这样也许最好玩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:953559c7-5aab-470f-b761-9cd92965bd1f", "text": "这样做，一来可以认识更多的中国朋友，二来可以锻炼你的口语。", "shortMeaning": "这么做既能多结识中国朋友，又能练口语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dc6bb7f6-6868-401e-a84d-c01925e02496", "text": "这样子我一箭双雕。", "shortMeaning": "这样我就一举两得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9cee84a-c808-4689-a590-b72bed6b5a8f", "text": "这样对待他似乎不太公平。", "shortMeaning": "这么待他似乎不太公平。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60c925a4-e148-4088-a657-81a4abe9f3d4", "text": "这样烂的菜还要这么贵啊！", "shortMeaning": "这么差的菜还要这么贵！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fa81b0a-11b6-4d5f-b10b-1b0aab868314", "text": "这样的举止只可能是个绅士。", "shortMeaning": "这样的举止，只能是位绅士。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c4f942e-65ff-4224-9f01-4f5df0908715", "text": "这样的事我还没听说过。", "shortMeaning": "这种事我还没听过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e1196e8-91ce-44f4-9326-e9401deddefe", "text": "这样的话，我会改变主意。", "shortMeaning": "那样的话，我就改主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6d5b3cc-36de-44ce-b5a6-eabb3b3e0906", "text": "这样的迷信还在他们中间流传。", "shortMeaning": "这种迷信在他们中间还流传着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ca8c310-cea1-45de-a50b-b0b910c9d67a", "text": "这样讯问只是警察例行公事。", "shortMeaning": "这样问话只是警察走程序。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fdc4a47d-bd5d-4e71-bad3-0a157c93fbb8", "text": "这样说是不是更加地道呢？", "shortMeaning": "这么说是不是更地道？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36e9790e-2fbd-41ee-a414-a900bd324b4a", "text": "这样辉煌的成绩，是如何取得的？", "shortMeaning": "这么耀眼的成绩是怎么来的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f8b2749e-99c0-4f12-a79d-fa0103879b93", "text": "这根本不是确定的。", "shortMeaning": "这根本没定下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12ed6f7d-2f9c-4e08-aeb6-8591d918b8ac", "text": "这根湿掉的火柴点不出火的。", "shortMeaning": "这根潮火柴划不出火。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17f93f77-0e7a-487d-b4db-6ad214ed817a", "text": "这棵600年的树，一人抱不住，甚至五人伸开手臂也合围不了。", "shortMeaning": "这棵六百年的树，一个人抱不过来，五个人伸手也合不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ecd8d31-edfe-4238-9c21-43a5dfb41c4f", "text": "这棵树停止生长了。", "shortMeaning": "这棵树不再长了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c7373c3-8c81-4aa9-83fe-49df7b9676dc", "text": "这棵树和屋顶差不多一样高。", "shortMeaning": "这树跟屋顶差不多高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4924ad30-4895-4e5d-b9b4-33fd5c26b65a", "text": "这次事故让我亲身体会到了系安全带是多么重要的一件事。", "shortMeaning": "这次事故让我亲身体会到系安全带多要紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8cac88f1-be6b-45ce-abc4-5acb330d42cb", "text": "这次交通事故中只有一个小男孩幸存了下来。", "shortMeaning": "这次车祸只有一个小男孩活了下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b51b1c5c-83e1-4f3d-b0c4-23f0b25212bf", "text": "这次出游下了三次雨。", "shortMeaning": "这回出游碰上了三场雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e183ed11-60f2-4bc3-a310-ff4e09d3df1b", "text": "这次升级的一个明显影响是用户会被强制重置密码。", "shortMeaning": "这次升级一个明显后果是用户得强制重设密码。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e63b85c-e8a7-4ae4-97a0-d0b1d9b4fea4", "text": "这次我走，我不会再回来了。", "shortMeaning": "这回我走了就不再回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5de623c3-5419-4b6e-8bac-f9dda23f7124", "text": "这次旅途下了三场雨。", "shortMeaning": "这趟旅途下了三场雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d03545d-c10f-4f8a-ac43-3159b69471cd", "text": "这次是我第二次去纽约了。", "shortMeaning": "这是我第二回去纽约。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52a28ab5-3cd7-4e72-a819-9fab0df1a5d0", "text": "这次校庆时，他将第一次做主角。", "shortMeaning": "这次校庆，他头一回当主角。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9929612-e5c4-4a37-b63b-b027bfe8c5cd", "text": "这次洪水泛滥渔民倒霉。", "shortMeaning": "这次发大水，渔民倒了霉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21544005-6741-4831-8dd3-30b98cfcb8af", "text": "这次直播没有剧本，但是很有节目效果。", "shortMeaning": "这次直播没本子，效果却很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:462925a4-3403-4ad6-83ef-cd47d5c00a4c", "text": "这次联合让两家公司的员工都感到有些害怕。", "shortMeaning": "这次合并让两家公司的员工都有点发怵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05e4e6e1-09be-4696-b006-dc68280af4c1", "text": "这次聚会只来了六个人。", "shortMeaning": "这次聚会只到了六个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cda289d3-d3ac-4da3-be71-b1a019be0dfc", "text": "这次胜利为他带来了巨大的声誉。", "shortMeaning": "这场胜仗给他带来很大名声。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45b1ca14-62ff-4a29-a1e6-41019012ef38", "text": "这次跑步比赛，三十五岁以下（包括三十五岁）的人参加青年组；三十六岁到五十岁的人参加中年组；五十一岁以上的人参加老年组。", "shortMeaning": "跑步赛分组：35岁以下进青年组，36到50岁进中年组，51岁以上进老年组。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:326b5a17-9d1a-4e9b-bca2-0f515fb6ee54", "text": "这次，虽然我的阅历更多但是没有人等着接待我。", "shortMeaning": "这回我阅历虽多，却没人等着接待我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e712032c-bfd8-49e8-b8aa-2836289566cd", "text": "这款手表是新型号。", "shortMeaning": "这款表是新款。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e59bc12c-15af-46e0-b4c9-cbc2878960e9", "text": "这款沙发可以折叠收纳，非常适合小户型。", "shortMeaning": "这款沙发能折叠收起来，小房子正合适。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e4e631f-6b2a-496f-9cdc-0843fad29575", "text": "这款游戏基于一本小说。", "shortMeaning": "这款游戏改编自一本小说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:584fa077-5549-4184-8480-69725b2cdf7b", "text": "这正可以说明你是个骗子。", "shortMeaning": "这正说明你是个骗子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2860cbb6-e38a-4636-8e3d-7fa18b6e6e5f", "text": "这正可以说明您是个骗子。", "shortMeaning": "这正说明您是个骗子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06930821-c29a-43ef-a567-54e1d228168c", "text": "这正如我想的一样。", "shortMeaning": "这跟我想的一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b86ed3d-1fa1-4135-b515-3b9660c45ca2", "text": "这正是我想看的视频。", "shortMeaning": "我想看的视频正是这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:164b9a0d-8e65-44f5-8336-933d51925f6c", "text": "这正是我需要的东西。", "shortMeaning": "我要的就是这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84dadba8-8452-4a85-9d60-a5a05254586f", "text": "这正是问题的关键。", "shortMeaning": "问题的关键正在这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0689737-3df2-4479-b3a5-0c9a7c9e10fc", "text": "这段旋律的演绎真是完美无瑕。", "shortMeaning": "这段旋律奏得完美无瑕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17cf4fb4-9028-42be-bc37-f73e9b0f5ed2", "text": "这段时间正好打算辞掉工作，说不定去得成。", "shortMeaning": "这阵子我正打算辞职，说不定能去成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b27b2725-9294-4ba0-8c7c-cd7487208aeb", "text": "这毋庸置疑是我吃过的最糟糕的一顿饭。", "shortMeaning": "这无疑是我吃过最糟的一顿饭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cebfc7d9-68a9-4e21-803c-89b55b405d3d", "text": "这水被石油污染了。", "shortMeaning": "这水让石油污染了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82e4980f-051f-49d3-941a-ecdb7698e9cf", "text": "这永远不会再发生了。", "shortMeaning": "这再也不会发生了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04cf1a45-3d29-46d1-857a-4d249bba6a1c", "text": "这没什么大不了的。", "shortMeaning": "这没什么大不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02510870-b873-4c8e-94cd-75d15b9ee6af", "text": "这活儿我干了一辈子。", "shortMeaning": "这活我干了一辈子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2550c66-063f-437f-ac16-8e753ec560f8", "text": "这点药一天吃三次。", "shortMeaning": "这点药一天分三次吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c3e1ce6-151b-4bc8-8e2b-8ca662cc2eec", "text": "这片小区的绿地面积有多少？", "shortMeaning": "这个小区的绿地有多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d95de258-a9f8-481a-9bba-9a94e57a9bda", "text": "这片森林的树主要是柏树。", "shortMeaning": "这片林子里主要是柏树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f31eb3f6-4a72-4dbd-9a66-6f5b347964a0", "text": "这片森林里能看到野兔。", "shortMeaning": "这片林子里能见到野兔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e09460c5-f5eb-4157-b14a-ef11bc7088bb", "text": "这片湖是日本最深的。", "shortMeaning": "日本最深的湖就数这片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbe4db07-77c5-43c4-8d80-c63b75473649", "text": "这玩意能存在，那一定有它存在的道理吧。", "shortMeaning": "这东西能留下，总有它的道理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:017cb768-f2ad-48bc-a339-49cf40dc4886", "text": "这电子辞典的好处就是便于携带。", "shortMeaning": "这电子词典的好处是随身好带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:251c2b13-fef2-46e9-ac19-4845960396ac", "text": "这男人是个语言学家，他自然知道。", "shortMeaning": "这男人是语言学家，自然懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abfe7b6b-e098-4b88-9037-d423d9877f0d", "text": "这男人试着安装他自己的天线。", "shortMeaning": "这男人试着自己装天线。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65654885-d1fe-469f-9319-812ea4e00733", "text": "这男孩是一头披着羊皮的狼。", "shortMeaning": "这男孩是披着羊皮的狼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:558cde3e-81c1-479f-a73c-194df0aef908", "text": "这男孩的口袋里有个苹果。", "shortMeaning": "这男孩口袋里有个苹果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f9daa23-3a96-4954-aecb-7d2eb5cd9a09", "text": "这盏灯发出了一束强光。", "shortMeaning": "这盏灯射出一道强光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5049d524-40de-4ed9-a5a5-7c5e880e47d8", "text": "这看起来似曾相识。", "shortMeaning": "这一切看着好像见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f30c2bec-5b35-458a-b6f8-354ad34870f2", "text": "这真令人头皮发麻。", "shortMeaning": "这真叫人头皮发紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:769bdd3f-4331-4bf8-bccf-4cd037e7ad31", "text": "这真是一个很善良的愿望。", "shortMeaning": "这愿望真是善良。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c7d011f-06a2-44be-94d7-4d464fb0a21d", "text": "这真是好得独一无二！", "shortMeaning": "这真是好得没得比！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c06bbf58-0734-4c33-90b6-664a5448e957", "text": "这真是彻底的虚伪！", "shortMeaning": "这真是十足的虚伪！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
